    <callActivity id="Id_dbf61ddc-58b8-40b7-9e20-d2e2475e58f3" name="SP1. Elaborar DFD" calledElement="Id_a5466ca9-bf6a-493f-90ab-60af0a517eb9">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_StartFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Decreto n&amp;ordm; 10.947, de 25 de janeiro de 2022. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Regulamenta o inciso VII do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 da Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133, de 1&amp;ordm; de abril de 2021, para dispor sobre o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual e instituir o Sistema de Planejamento e Gerenciamento de Contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es no &amp;acirc;mbito da administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o p&amp;uacute;blica federal direta, aut&amp;aacute;rquica e fundacional.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 8&amp;ordm; &amp;nbsp;Para elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual, o requisitante preencher&amp;aacute; o documento de formaliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de demanda no PGC com as seguintes informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8i"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - justificativa da necessidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8ii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o sucinta do objeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8iii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;III - quantidade a ser contratada, quando couber, considerada a expectativa de consumo anual;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8iv"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IV - estimativa preliminar do valor da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, por meio de procedimento simplificado, de acordo com as orienta&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es da Secretaria de Gest&amp;atilde;o da Secretaria Especial de Desburocratiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, Gest&amp;atilde;o e Governo Digital do Minist&amp;eacute;rio da Economia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8v"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da data pretendida para a conclus&amp;atilde;o da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, a fim de n&amp;atilde;o gerar preju&amp;iacute;zos ou descontinuidade das atividades do &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o ou da entidade;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8vi"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VI - grau de prioridade da compra ou da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o em baixo, m&amp;eacute;dio ou alto, de acordo com a metodologia estabelecida pelo &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o ou pela entidade contratante;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8vii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VII - indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de vincula&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou depend&amp;ecirc;ncia com o objeto de outro documento de formaliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de demanda para a sua execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, com vistas a determinar a sequ&amp;ecirc;ncia em que as contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es ser&amp;atilde;o realizadas; e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8viii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VIII - nome da &amp;aacute;rea requisitante ou t&amp;eacute;cnica com a identifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do respons&amp;aacute;vel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_EndFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="runtimeProperties" value="{&quot;priority&quot;:0,&quot;asynchronousBehavior&quot;:{},&quot;subProcessType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;inputMappingType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;outputMappingType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;exitMode&quot;:&quot;AllTokens&quot;}" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_e0575b33-cd77-440b-83a6-3dcea749f4d0</incoming>
